# Proxy Configuration Examples
# 
# Supported formats:
# 1. SOCKS5 with authentication: socks5://username:password@host:port
# 2. SOCKS5 without auth: socks5://host:port or simply host:port
# 3. HTTP with authentication: http://username:password@host:port
# 4. Colon-separated format: host:port:username:password
#
# Examples:

# SOCKS5 with auth
# socks5://myuser:mypass@proxy1.example.com:1080

# SOCKS5 without auth
# socks5://proxy2.example.com:1080
# proxy3.example.com:1080

# HTTP with auth
# http://myuser:mypass@proxy4.example.com:8080

# Colon-separated format (auto-detected as SOCKS5 or HTTP)
# proxy5.example.com:8080:username:password

# Add your proxies below (one per line, remove the # to uncomment):
